{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12SwiftCluster13RandomizedSVDO","title":"RandomizedSVD","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"Randomized Singular Value Decomposition using the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/Result"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/compute(X:nComponents:nOversamples:nPowerIter:seed:)"],"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods","generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomizedsvd"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computes an approximate rank-k SVD of an M×N matrix A:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A ≈ U * diag(S) * Vᵀ"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"where U is M×k orthonormal, S is k-vector of singular values, Vᵀ is k×N."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Complexity","type":"heading","anchor":"Complexity","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(M·